Package: m6APrediction
Title: Prediction of m6A Sites Using a Random Forest Model
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Chengyang", "Zhang",
    email = "zcy20060829@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Predicts m6A modification sites using a fitted random forest
    model and sequence-derived features. Provides functions for batch
    prediction and single-site prediction, with example input data
    and a fitted model.
